# skills/in-progress/

Staging lane for skills under active development. Skills here are excluded from:

- `scripts/build_capability_graph.py` (not indexed in CAPABILITY_GRAPH.json)
- `scripts/capability_query.py resolve` (not returned in routing results)
- `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` (not distributed to external installs)

Promote to `skills/<name>/` when frontmatter is complete, the skill has been
exercised at least once, and it's earned `[PROBATIONARY]` status.

Convention adopted 2026-05-16 from mattpocock/skills (see `docs/adr/0001-...`).
